1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:06,380
Hold on tight! We are racing right beside the Great Zebra Migration!

2
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:20,151
Spin the camera all around—zebras are galloping next to our open jeep!

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,319
Watch our knobby tires kick up red dust while the herd thunders past!

4
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:55,008
Splash! Right across the shallow Mara River in golden spray!

5
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,040
Every zebra’s stripes are unique, like a fingerprint in full gallop!

6
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,994
Thousands of zebras follow the fresh grass together across Africa!

7
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:55,644
What a ride into the sunset! Ready to pick your next wild adventure?
